      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 3: Folio 3r, left side",
          "value": "\n\n<ol><li>\n<p>your prayer is invalid.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If, during the second rak\u02bfa,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>you do not sit down,&nbsp;your prayer is invalid.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n<li>\n<p>If you forget to recite the tah\u0323iyya\u0304t,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>whether all of it,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>or a little of it, or</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>in the first tah\u0323iyya\u0304t or&nbsp;</p>\n</li></ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
